# Duralap

> Enterprise-Grade Real-Time Messaging Platform

Version: 1.0

Status: Active Development

---

# Project Vision

Duralap is an enterprise-grade real-time messaging platform designed as a production-ready software engineering project.

The goal is not to clone WhatsApp, Telegram, Messenger, or Discord.

Instead, Duralap combines the best features from these platforms while following modern enterprise software engineering practices.

This project is built for:

- Learning
- Portfolio
- Final Year Project
- Production-ready Reference Application

---

